{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your weapon. Speak to survive, or stay silent to stay alive. You owe a debt to the Whisper Protocol: search your environment for hidden words to unlock four voice-sealed locks and claim what you need to pay it back. But monsters are listening. They hunt through sound. Use vocal bonds, voice-activated cards to turn the tide. Will you wield them against the creatures stalking you, or betray your allies and cast them out like lambs to the slaughter?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024590?t=1761537563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024590?t=1761537563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024590/9ee16e93fd13621e6287f220a1e4eafa1f20d106/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761537563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024590/9ee16e93fd13621e6287f220a1e4eafa1f20d106/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761537563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your weapon. Speak to survive, or stay silent to stay alive. You owe a debt to the Whisper Protocol: search your environment for hidden words to unlock four voice-sealed locks and claim what you need to pay it back. But monsters are listening. They hunt through sound. Use vocal bonds, voice-activated cards to turn the tide. Will you wield them against the creatures stalking you, or betray your allies and cast them out like lambs to the slaughter?</p>","developers":["BAXON GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_